  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A) Given</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing function.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math> is incorrect.</p><p>LHS is increasing and unbounded function.</p><p>(B) Given<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><msup><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#968;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing function.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math> is incorrect because LHS <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math> when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msubsup><msqrt><mi>t</mi></msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub